{
  "TitleJP": "不思議な機械（２）",
  "TitleKR": "이상한 기계 2",
  "TitleEN": "A Strange Machine 2",
  "TitleTH": "อุปกรณ์ประหลาด 2",
  "TitleTW": "不可思議的機器（２）",
  "DescJP": "様子がおかしくなってしまったアリスは、周囲の声も届かぬまま部室を破壊し、その場にいるすべての人にその銃口を向けてしまう。誰もアリスを止める事ができずにいたその瞬間、C&Cが現れ、アリスを気絶させた上で機械を倒してくれ――安堵の息を吐いたのも束の間、ミドリが悲痛な声をあげる。そこには、倒れ伏したまま動かないモモイの姿があった。",
  "DescKR": "폭주한 아리스는 이성을 잃은 채, 부실을 파괴하고 그 자리의 모두에게 공격을 가한다. 그 누구도 아리스를 막지 못하는 위기일발의 상황. 그때 C&C가 나타나 아리스를 기절시키고 수상한 로봇을 처치한다. 안도의 한숨을 내쉬던 그때, 선생님은 미도리로부터 예상치 못했던 소식을 전달 받는다.",
  "DescEN": "Aris goes into a frenzy and loses consciousness, destroying the clubroom and attacking everyone in her wake. No one is able to stop Aris and the situation grows critical. At that moment, the C&C appears and knocks her out, then proceeds to defeat the suspicious machine. Everyone breathes a sigh of relief, but then Sensei receives an unexpected piece of news from Midori.",
  "DescTH": "อาริสึมีท่าทางแปลกๆ และควบคุมตัวเองไม่ได้ เธอเริ่มทำลายห้องชมรม\nและโจมตีทุกคนที่อยู่ในนั้น นับเป็นสถานการณ์วิกฤตเพราะไม่มีใครหยุดเธอ\nเอาไว้ได้ ในตอนนั้นเอง C&C ก็ปรากฏตัวและช่วยกำจัดหุ่นยนต์ประหลาด\nและทำให้อาริสึสลบไปด้วย ในขณะที่ทุกคนโล่งอกที่ไม่มีใครบาดเจ็บ\nคุณครูก็ได้ฟังข่าวที่ไม่คาดคิดจากมิโดริ",
  "DescTW": "暴走的愛麗絲失去理智，破壞了部室且攻擊了在場的所有人。情況岌岌可危，沒有人能阻止愛麗絲。C&C突然現身讓愛麗絲昏厥，並且解決了可疑的機器人。正當覺得鬆一口氣時，老師從綠的口中得知出乎意料之外的消息。",
  "DialogJP": [
    {
      "Text": "第7話;不思議な機械（２）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3660500344,
      "Name": "ハレ",
      "Text": "ゲホッゲホッ………"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "マキ",
      "Text": "い、一体何が起きてるの！？"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "コタマ",
      "Text": "突然眠っていたロボットが起動……。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "コタマ",
      "Text": "そして爆発が……あれは、明確な攻撃です。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3660500344,
      "Name": "ハレ",
      "Text": "攻撃命令を出してたのは……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "アリス",
      "Text": "……有機体の生存反応を確認。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "アリス",
      "Text": "失敗を確認しました。"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"アリス……！\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3353674757,
      "Name": "ユズ",
      "Text": "あ、アリスちゃん！？"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "アリス",
      "Text": "……プロトコルを再実行します。武装のリロード開始。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "コタマ",
      "Text": "また……レールガンの充電を始めました！"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"……早く止めないと！\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"みんな、アリスをお願い……！\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "マキ",
      "Text": "アリスちゃん！！ごめん！！！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1414477782,
      "Name": "アリス",
      "Text": "妨害を確認、充電失敗。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "マキ",
      "Text": "よし！止まった！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1414477782,
      "Name": "アリス",
      "Text": "……妨害要素を排除します。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "マキ",
      "Text": "……え？"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3660500344,
      "Name": "ハレ",
      "Text": "マキ！危ない！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "マキ",
      "Text": "……！！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "コタマ",
      "Text": "マキ！！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "アリス",
      "Text": "プロトコルを再実行します。武装のリロード開始。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3353674757,
      "Name": "ユズ",
      "Text": "あ、ああ……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 484846910,
      "Name": "ミドリ",
      "Text": "い、一体なに……アリスちゃん！ねえ、アリスちゃん！"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"くっ！アリス……！\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] （一体……どうすれば……！）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "アリス",
      "Text": "発――"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2746145574,
      "Name": "？？？",
      "Text": "おい、チビ。\nそこまでだ。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "アリス",
      "Text": "………！！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "ネル",
      "Text": "大人しく寝てろ。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "ネル",
      "Text": "こいつら、ここにもいやがったのか……。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "ネル",
      "Text": "はぁ……片付けるか。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "ネル",
      "Text": "おい、行くぞ。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4079356321,
      "Name": "アスナ",
      "Text": "はーい！部長！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4220213473,
      "Name": "カリン",
      "Text": "支援する。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1872351598,
      "Name": "アカネ",
      "Text": "ええ、後方はお任せください。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4079356321,
      "Name": "アスナ",
      "Text": "これで終わり！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4220213473,
      "Name": "カリン",
      "Text": "作戦終了。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1872351598,
      "Name": "アカネ",
      "Text": "お疲れ様でした。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "ネル",
      "Text": "……これでいいか？先生。"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"ネル、みんな！ありがとう！\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "ネル",
      "Text": "んで、何があったんだ？"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "ネル",
      "Text": "すげぇ音がしたから来てみたら、部室がボロボロじゃねぇか。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "ネル",
      "Text": "それに、チビのあの姿は一体……。"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"ごめん、ちょっと待ってね……みんな大丈夫！？\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3660500344,
      "Name": "ハレ",
      "Text": "うっ……な、なんとか……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "マキ",
      "Text": "うえぇぇ……内臓飛び出ちゃうかと思ったぁああ……。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "コタマ",
      "Text": "軽口が言えるのだから、とりあえず無事ですね。"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"それなら良かった……。\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 484846910,
      "Name": "ミドリ",
      "Text": "先生……！先生！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3353674757,
      "Name": "ユズ",
      "Text": "あ、ああ、モ、モモイ………"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"ミドリ、ユズ……どうしたの……？\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 484846910,
      "Name": "ミドリ",
      "Text": "お姉ちゃんが……お姉ちゃんが……！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "ネル",
      "Text": "……。"
    },
    {
      "Text": "次回;崩れた日常"
    }
  ],
  "DialogKR": [
    {
      "Text": "제7화;이상한 기계 2"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3660500344,
      "Name": "하레",
      "Text": "콜록콜록………"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "마키",
      "Text": "무, 무슨 일이 벌어진 거야?!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "코타마",
      "Text": "갑자기 잠들어 있던 로봇들이 작동하고……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "코타마",
      "Text": "뒤이어 이어진 폭발…… 저건, 명백한 공격입니다!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3660500344,
      "Name": "하레",
      "Text": "방금 그 공격의 주체는 분명……."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "아리스",
      "Text": "\"……유기체의 생존 반응 확인.\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "아리스",
      "Text": "\"케이스 해결의 실패를 확인하였습니다.\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"아리스……!\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3353674757,
      "Name": "유즈",
      "Text": "아, 아리스 쨩?!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "아리스",
      "Text": "\"……프로토콜의 재실행에 들어갑니다. 보유 무장의 재장전 시퀀스 개시.\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "코타마",
      "Text": "또다시…… 레일건, 충전을 시작했습니다!"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"또…… 발사되기 전에 막아야 해!\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"모두 부탁해! 아리스를……!\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "마키",
      "Text": "이야아압!! 미안! 아리스 쨩!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1414477782,
      "Name": "아리스",
      "Text": "\"방해 요소를 확인, 충전 실패.\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "마키",
      "Text": "좋았어! 막았다!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1414477782,
      "Name": "아리스",
      "Text": "\"……방해 요소를 우선 배제합니다.\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "마키",
      "Text": "……엉?"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3660500344,
      "Name": "하레",
      "Text": "마키! 위험해!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "마키",
      "Text": "……!!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "코타마",
      "Text": "마키!!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "아리스",
      "Text": "\"프로토콜을 재실행합니다. 보유 무장의 재장전 시퀀스 개시.\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3353674757,
      "Name": "유즈",
      "Text": "아, 아아……."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 484846910,
      "Name": "미도리",
      "Text": "대, 대체…… 아리스 쨩! 아리스 쨩!"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"크윽! 아리스……!\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] (아리스를 막으려면……. 어떻게 해야……!)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "아리스",
      "Text": "\"발ㅍ───\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2746145574,
      "Name": "???",
      "Text": "어이, 꼬맹이. 거기까지다."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "아리스",
      "Text": "\"………!!\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "네루",
      "Text": "거기서 잠자코 얌전히 자고 있으라고."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "네루",
      "Text": "……이 자식들, 여기에도……."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "네루",
      "Text": "하아. 됐어. 정리해버리면 그만이니까."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "네루",
      "Text": "어이, 간다."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4079356321,
      "Name": "아스나",
      "Text": "응! 부장!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4220213473,
      "Name": "카린",
      "Text": "지원하겠어."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1872351598,
      "Name": "아카네",
      "Text": "네, 뒤는 맡겨만 주세요."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4079356321,
      "Name": "아스나",
      "Text": "이걸로 끝!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4220213473,
      "Name": "카린",
      "Text": "작전 종료."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1872351598,
      "Name": "아카네",
      "Text": "수고하셨습니다."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "네루",
      "Text": "……해서 상황은 정리했다만, 선생."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"네루랑 모두! 고마워!\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "네루",
      "Text": "대체 무슨 일이 있었던 거야?"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "네루",
      "Text": "다른 녀석들은 찌그러진 캔처럼 굴러다니지. 거기다 동아리 건물은 완전히 박살이 나버렸고."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "네루",
      "Text": "아까 꼬맹이의 그 수상한 모습은 대체……."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"잠깐! 답변은 나중에! 그보다 다들 괜찮아?!\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3660500344,
      "Name": "하레",
      "Text": "으읏…… 어, 어떻게든……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "마키",
      "Text": "우에엑…… 내장이 튀어나오는 줄 알았어어어어어……."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "코타마",
      "Text": "이런 말을 하는 거 보니, 일단 무사한 모양이에요."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"그렇다면 다행…….\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 484846910,
      "Name": "미도리",
      "Text": "선생님……! 선생님!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3353674757,
      "Name": "유즈",
      "Text": "아, 아아, 모모이………"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"미도리……? 유즈? 왜 그래……?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 484846910,
      "Name": "미도리",
      "Text": "언니가…… 언니가………!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "네루",
      "Text": "……."
    },
    {
      "Text": "다음화;무너진 일상"
    }
  ],
  "DialogEN": [
    {
      "Text": "Episode 7; A Strange Machine 2"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3660500344,
      "Name": "Hare",
      "Text": "*cough* *cough*"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "Maki",
      "Text": "Wh-What happened?!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "Kotama",
      "Text": "The robots we found powered up out of nowhere!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "Kotama",
      "Text": "That explosion! They were trying to attack us!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3660500344,
      "Name": "Hare",
      "Text": "What's their target?"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "Aris",
      "Text": "\"...Organism's survival response has been confirmed.\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "Aris",
      "Text": "\"Resolution failed.\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"Aris...!\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3353674757,
      "Name": "Yuzu",
      "Text": "A-Aris?!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "Aris",
      "Text": "\"...Re-executing protocol. Reload sequence of weapons initiated.\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "Kotama",
      "Text": "Not again... The railgun is charging!"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"We can't let her fire again!\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"Everyone, we need to stop Aris!\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "Maki",
      "Text": "Hiyaaa! Sorry, Aris!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1414477782,
      "Name": "Aris",
      "Text": "\"Obstacle confirmed. Charge failed.\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "Maki",
      "Text": "All right! We stopped her!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1414477782,
      "Name": "Aris",
      "Text": "\"...Removing obstacle.\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "Maki",
      "Text": "...Is she serious?"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3660500344,
      "Name": "Hare",
      "Text": "Maki! Watch out!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "Maki",
      "Text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "Kotama",
      "Text": "Maki!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "Aris",
      "Text": "\"Re-executing protocol. Reload sequence of weapons initiated.\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3353674757,
      "Name": "Yuzu",
      "Text": "Oh, no... Oh dear..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 484846910,
      "Name": "Midori",
      "Text": "Aris? Aris! C'mon! It's us!"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"Ugh! Aris...!\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"(What should we do...to stop Aris...?!)\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "Aris",
      "Text": "\"Fir—\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2746145574,
      "Name": "???",
      "Text": "Hey, kid. That's enough."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "Aris",
      "Text": "\"...!\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "Neru",
      "Text": "It's your bedtime."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "Neru",
      "Text": "Of course the whole gang's here."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "Neru",
      "Text": "*sigh* It's not ideal, but get rid of them."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "Neru",
      "Text": "No hard feelings, okay?"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4079356321,
      "Name": "Asuna",
      "Text": "Whatever you say, President!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4220213473,
      "Name": "Karin",
      "Text": "I'll provide support."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1872351598,
      "Name": "Akane",
      "Text": "Yes. We can handle it from here."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4079356321,
      "Name": "Asuna",
      "Text": "All set!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4220213473,
      "Name": "Karin",
      "Text": "End of operation."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1872351598,
      "Name": "Akane",
      "Text": "Another successful mission."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "Neru",
      "Text": "...So, that's that, Sensei."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"Thank you, Neru, everyone!\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "Neru",
      "Text": "What happened?"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "Neru",
      "Text": "They're all rolling around like smashed cans, and the club building is destroyed."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "Neru",
      "Text": "And what's up with the kid?"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"Wait, I'll explain later! Is everyone okay?!\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3660500344,
      "Name": "Hare",
      "Text": "Ugh... S-Somehow..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "Maki",
      "Text": "Yuck... I thought my intestines were gonna spill out..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "Kotama",
      "Text": "Again, you're being dramatic."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"I'm glad you all seem okay...\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 484846910,
      "Name": "Midori",
      "Text": "Sensei...! Sensei!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3353674757,
      "Name": "Yuzu",
      "Text": "Oh, Momoi..."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"Midori...? Yuzu? What's wrong...?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 484846910,
      "Name": "Midori",
      "Text": "She...she's...!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "Neru",
      "Text": "..."
    },
    {
      "Text": "Next Episode; Daily Life Destroyed"
    }
  ],
  "DialogTH": [
    {
      "Text": "ตอนที่ 7;อุปกรณ์ประหลาด 2"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3660500344,
      "Name": "ฮาเระ",
      "Text": "แค่กๆๆ..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "มากิ",
      "Text": "กะ... เกิดเรื่องอะไรขึ้นน่ะ?!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "โคทามะ",
      "Text": "ทำไมจู่ๆ หุ่นยนต์ที่ดับอยู่ถึงกลับมาทำงานได้..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "โคทามะ",
      "Text": "แถมยังมีระเบิดตามมาด้วย... นี่เป็นการโจมตีที่โจ่งแจ้งเลยค่ะ!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3660500344,
      "Name": "ฮาเระ",
      "Text": "แล้วคนที่โจมตีเมื่อกี้ก็คือ..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "อาริสึ",
      "Text": "\"...ตรวจพบปฏิกิริยาตอบสนองของสิ่งมีชีวิต\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "อาริสึ",
      "Text": "\"ตรวจพบความล้มเหลวในการแก้ปัญหา\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"อาริสึ...!\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3353674757,
      "Name": "ยูสึ",
      "Text": "อะ... อาริสึจัง?!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "อาริสึ",
      "Text": "\"......เริ่มดำเนินการใช้งานโปรโตคอลอีกครั้ง เริ่มรีโหลดอาวุธ...\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "โคทามะ",
      "Text": "เธอเริ่มชาร์จเรลกัน... อีกแล้วละค่ะ!"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"ต้องหยุดให้ได้ ก่อนที่เธอจะยิงเรลกันอีก!!\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"ฝากอาริสึด้วยนะทุกคน...!\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "มากิ",
      "Text": "ย้ากกก!! ขอโทษนะอาริสึจัง!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1414477782,
      "Name": "อาริสึ",
      "Text": "\"พบปัจจัยรบกวน ชาร์จไม่สำเร็จ\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "มากิ",
      "Text": "ดีละ! หยุดไว้ได้แล้ว!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1414477782,
      "Name": "อาริสึ",
      "Text": "\"......กำจัดปัจจัยรบกวน\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "มากิ",
      "Text": "เอาจริงดิ...?"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3660500344,
      "Name": "ฮาเระ",
      "Text": "มากิ! อันตราย!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "มากิ",
      "Text": "......!!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "โคทามะ",
      "Text": "มากิ!!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "อาริสึ",
      "Text": "\"เริ่มเปิดใช้งานโปรโตคอลใหม่... เริ่มรีโหลดอาวุธ...\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3353674757,
      "Name": "ยูสึ",
      "Text": "อะ... อาริสึ..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 484846910,
      "Name": "มิโดริ",
      "Text": "นี่มันอะไรกันเนี่ย... อาริสึจัง! อาริสึจัง!"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] \"อึก! อาริสึ...!\""
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns] (ทำยังไงดีถึงจะขัดขวางอาริสึได้ละเนี่ย...!)"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "อาริสึ",
      "Text": "\"ยิง───\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2746145574,
      "Name": "???",
      "Text": "นี่ ยัยเด็กน้อย หยุดได้แล้วน่า"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "อาริสึ",
      "Text": "\"...!!\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "เนรุ",
      "Text": "นอนนิ่งๆ อยู่ตรงนั้นไปก่อนล่ะ"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "เนรุ",
      "Text": "...เจ้าพวกนี้นี่ ยกมาทั้งโขยงเลยเรอะ"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "เนรุ",
      "Text": "เฮ้อ พอกันที มาทำความสะอาดกันเลยดีมั้ย?"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "เนรุ",
      "Text": "ลุย!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4079356321,
      "Name": "อาสึนะ",
      "Text": "อื้ม! หัวหน้า!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4220213473,
      "Name": "คาริน",
      "Text": "ฉันจะช่วยอีกแรงเอง"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1872351598,
      "Name": "อาคาเนะ",
      "Text": "ใช่ค่ะ ฉันจะระวังหลังให้เองค่ะ!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4079356321,
      "Name": "อาสึนะ",
      "Text": "ปิดจ๊อบ!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4220213473,
      "Name": "คาริน",
      "Text": "สิ้นสุดปฏิบัติการ"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1872351598,
      "Name": "อาคาเนะ",
      "Text": "ทำได้ดีมากค่ะทุกคน"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "เนรุ",
      "Text": "...เราจัดการสถานการณ์ได้แล้วครู"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"ขอบใจนะ! ทั้งเนรุและทุกคนเลย!\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "เนรุ",
      "Text": "ว่าแต่ นี่มันเรื่องอะไรกันเนี่ย?"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "เนรุ",
      "Text": "ทำไมถึงกลิ้งกันไปมาเหมือนกระป๋องที่โดนทุบจนบุบๆ เบี้ยวๆ แถมอาคารของชมรมก็พังยับเยินอีก"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "เนรุ",
      "Text": "แล้วที่เด็กน้อยดูแปลกๆ ไปเมื่อกี้มันอะไรน่ะ..."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"เดี๋ยวก่อน! เอาไว้ตอบทีหลังนะ! ทุกคนไม่เป็นอะไรกันใช่ไหม?!\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3660500344,
      "Name": "ฮาเระ",
      "Text": "อึก... ก็... ยังครบ 32 อยู่..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "มากิ",
      "Text": "โอ้ย... นึกว่าไส้จะทะลักออกมาซะแล้ว..."
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "โคทามะ",
      "Text": "ถ้ายังพูดแบบนี้ได้อยู่ แสดงว่าก็ยังปลอดภัยดีนะคะ"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"งั้นก็โล่งอกไปที...\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 484846910,
      "Name": "มิโดริ",
      "Text": "คุณครู...! คุณครู!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3353674757,
      "Name": "ยูสึ",
      "Text": "มะ... โมโมอิ..."
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s] \"มิโดริ...? ยูสึ? มีอะไรเหรอ...?\""
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 484846910,
      "Name": "มิโดริ",
      "Text": "พี่โมโมอิ... พี่เค้าน่ะ...!"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "เนรุ",
      "Text": "......"
    },
    {
      "Text": "ตอนต่อไป;วันดีๆ ที่พังลง"
    }
  ],
  "DialogTW": [
    {
      "Text": "第7話;不可思議的機器（２）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3660500344,
      "Name": "晴",
      "Text": "咳咳咳……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "真紀",
      "Text": "到，到底發生什麼事了！？"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "小玉",
      "Text": "沉睡中的機器人突然啟動……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "小玉",
      "Text": "接著發生爆炸……那，非常明顯是攻擊！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3660500344,
      "Name": "晴",
      "Text": "發出攻擊命令的是……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "愛麗絲",
      "Text": "……確認到有機體的生存反應。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "愛麗絲",
      "Text": "已確認失敗……"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s]「愛麗絲……！」"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3353674757,
      "Name": "柚子",
      "Text": "愛，愛麗絲醬！？"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "愛麗絲",
      "Text": "……再次執行協議。重新裝填武裝。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "小玉",
      "Text": "電磁砲……又再次開始充電了！"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns]「……得趕快阻止才行！」"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns]「大家，將愛麗絲……！」"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "真紀",
      "Text": "愛麗絲醬！！抱歉了！！！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1414477782,
      "Name": "愛麗絲",
      "Text": "確認到妨礙，充電失敗。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "真紀",
      "Text": "很好！停下來了！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1414477782,
      "Name": "愛麗絲",
      "Text": "……排除妨礙要素。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "真紀",
      "Text": "……咦？"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3660500344,
      "Name": "晴",
      "Text": "真紀！危險！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "真紀",
      "Text": "……！！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "小玉",
      "Text": "真紀！！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "愛麗絲",
      "Text": "再次執行協議。重新裝填武裝。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3353674757,
      "Name": "柚子",
      "Text": "啊，啊啊……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 484846910,
      "Name": "綠",
      "Text": "這，這到底是……愛麗絲醬！吶，愛麗絲醬！"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns]「唔！愛麗絲……！」"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[ns]（究竟……該怎麼做……！）"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "愛麗絲",
      "Text": "發──"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2746145574,
      "Name": "???",
      "Text": "喂，小不點。\n到此為止了。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3797093869,
      "Name": "愛麗絲",
      "Text": "……！！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "寧瑠",
      "Text": "乖乖睡吧。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "寧瑠",
      "Text": "這些傢伙，還想搗亂啊……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "寧瑠",
      "Text": "唉……收拾它們吧。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "寧瑠",
      "Text": "喂，要上了。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4079356321,
      "Name": "明日奈",
      "Text": "好的～！部長！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4220213473,
      "Name": "花凛",
      "Text": "我來支援。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1872351598,
      "Name": "朱音",
      "Text": "是，後方就交給我吧。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4079356321,
      "Name": "明日奈",
      "Text": "這樣就搞定了！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 4220213473,
      "Name": "花凛",
      "Text": "作戰結束。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1872351598,
      "Name": "朱音",
      "Text": "辛苦了。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "寧瑠",
      "Text": "……這樣可以嗎？老師。"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s]「寧瑠、大家！謝謝妳們！」"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "寧瑠",
      "Text": "所以呢，發生什麼事了？"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "寧瑠",
      "Text": "聽到了很大的聲響所以過來看看，社辦都破破爛爛了啊。"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "寧瑠",
      "Text": "還有，小不點的那副模樣究竟……"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s]「抱歉，先等一下……大家還好嗎！？」"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3660500344,
      "Name": "晴",
      "Text": "唔……勉，勉勉強強……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 2138799070,
      "Name": "真紀",
      "Text": "唔呃……還以為內臟要飛出來了……"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 1491222734,
      "Name": "小玉",
      "Text": "還能開玩笑，看來沒事呢。"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s]「那就好……」"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 484846910,
      "Name": "綠",
      "Text": "老師……！老師！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3353674757,
      "Name": "柚子",
      "Text": "啊，啊啊，桃，桃井……"
    },
    {
      "Text": "[s]「綠、柚子……怎麼了……？」"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 484846910,
      "Name": "綠",
      "Text": "姐姐她……！姐姐她………！"
    },
    {
      "CharacterName": 3431605305,
      "Name": "寧瑠",
      "Text": "……"
    },
    {
      "Text": "下一話;崩壞的日常"
    }
  ]
